# GENERATED by codegen/e2e_bridge.py (codegen/e2e_vlm_vvl.py). Do not edit.
# l8_Attestation (the block body's list of variable-size Attestation, W = vvl_l8_Attestation) read at a byte window at any tree
# depth d < 31, the window's end below 2^32 (hw32): the reader's Array.set chain is RT.am of tree updates FT_l8_Attestation
# (rvF_l8_Attestation; each element written is th_bx of its mirror, eqE_l8_Attestation); element 0 of FT_l8_Attestation is the first write
# (lemV_l8_Attestation), element 1 + c the write of element c (lemN_l8_Attestation); an element's view is its window's value
# (e2e_wxa.vw_Attestation). vl: the list's root view is the window's value.

